he\",\"x\":0.5366876304021615,\"y\":0.7223837206590875,\"width\":0.3752620549888288,\"height\":0.01453488377872425},{\"text\":\"room. Besides, some photographs which\",\"x\":0.5366876339136918,\"y\":0.7078175896636703,\"width\":0.3752620549888288,\"height\":0.014657980456026065},{\"text\":\"were taken during our excursions on Ma\",\"x\":0.5364405154810823,\"y\":0.6910715510351755,\"width\":0.3757176654919744,\"height\":0.02037191049283793},{\"text\":\"Wan Islands, Cheung Chau, Ping Chau\",\"x\":0.5366876292141811,\"y\":0.678779069980793,\"width\":0.3752620549888288,\"height\":0.01453488377872425},{\"text\":\"and Ma Sze Chau area were displayed too.\",\"x\":0.5322738270699641,\"y\":0.661742128789755,\"width\":0.38204677578198487,\"height\":0.01910130317514025},{\"text\":\"Information about Hong Kong, old and\",\"x\":0.5345911904433522,\"y\":0.6482084687552441,\"width\":0.37735849489945905,\"height\":0.014657980456026065},{\"text\":\"new, was given by our adviser, Mr. Chau\",\"x\":0.536687627816557,\"y\":0.6351744188180022,\"width\":0.3752620549888288,\"height\":0.014662714656867193},{\"text\":\"Sui Hay, and this stimulated the interests\",\"x\":0.5345911907054068,\"y\":0.6175895766329723,\"width\":0.37735849489945905,\"height\":0.016286644951140072},{\"text\":\"of most Visitors, especially the older ones.\",\"x\":0.5366876370408754,\"y\":0.6045602608655132,\"width\":0.3752620549888288,\"height\":0.013172296903032454},{\"text\":\"The colourful pictures of the ‘old' and\",\"x\":0.5366876298169063,\"y\":0.5901162788591844,\"width\":0.3752620549888288,\"height\":0.014534883778724361},{\"text\":\"‘new’ Hong Kong gave a sharp and dis-\",\"x\":0.5324947628473871,\"y\":0.5755700322651989,\"width\":0.37945490610117294,\"height\":0.015999734984158742},{\"text\":\"tinct contrast and as well enhanced the\",\"x\":0.5366876345391286,\"y\":0.5625000001592793,\"width\":0.3752620549888288,\"height\":0.011767100977198686},{\"text\":\"beauty of the room.\",\"x\":0.5366876364837325,\"y\